  speakerName: Fisherman
  lines:
  - Traveler! Goblins found dynamite and are attacking our village by the lake!
  - Take this fishing bow. Aim with your mouse and Left-Click to pick them off!
  - Defeat 4 TNT Goblins before they blow us to pieces!
  startsQuest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1110000000000000000000000000001, type: 2}
  inProgressLines:
  - The dynamite goblins are still attacking! Use your bow!
  completedLines:
  - You drove off the goblins! Now we can fish in peace!
